  "sourceCoordinateContract": "Only official BNO STEP uses sourceToWorld; all other STEP files and ALL meshFile assets are alreadyworld coordinates. The correct3x3 rotation determinant is+1.",
  "assemblyOrder": [
    "Place unconnected BNO085 board from world\u2212X onto the four locating pins; source component side faces\u2212X.",
    "Connect CONN4 from world\u2212Y through the repaired aperture, with rear cover still off.",
    "Seat the original four-screw rear cover from\u2212X; annular stops locate only PCB mounting-hole surrounds.",
    "Fasten original four rear-cover screws; check0.2mm maximum nominal axial freeplay and no component compression.",
    "Thread one4.8mm nylon tie through the integral cover slots after closure to retain the four insulated leads.",
    "The four free ends stop at the open neck-root boundary. Do not treat them as seated Pi connectors."
  ],
  "hardware": "Reuse the original fourM2 rear-cover screws. No new screw or separate printed clip. One nylon tie receiving path; spare stock not asserted.",
